WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Jingzhang Rising. A century of self-reliance; the character ren rises.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:16.000
The railway was completed in 1909; the demonstration zone was approved in 2009. Exactly one hundred years apart, on the same corridor.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:25.000
The Central Axis arranges order; the Jing-Zhang line negotiates reality. No new statutory axis is proposed here.

4
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The spine runs 9.57 kilometres. Three terraces step from north to south, and seven stitching links repair the east-west severance.

5
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:46.000
In March 1949 the Central Committee's train arrived at Tsinghuayuan Station, whose site lies within this design area. Four origins form a 9.6 kilometre route.

6
00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:57.000
AI must not become the only way to obtain a public service. The fallback is always the human lane, never a second AI system.

7
00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:07.000
Regulatory conditions, title and building data have not been obtained. This proposal would rather give one fewer number than sacrifice rigour.

8
00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:15.000
Let the spirit of self-reliance rise again, on the same corridor, as the character ren of Chinese artificial intelligence.
